{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.koito.park",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "傍晚的公园，她站在游乐设施前",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.koito.park",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.koito.park",
    "idolId": "koito",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "──啊…………",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，已经这个时间了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "明明还很亮呢……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……小朋友们都好好地跟着晚霞的钟声回去了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哈哈，小糸也去公园坐坐吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "开个玩笑──",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "诶……！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "可、可以吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，倒是没关系……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "哇、哇……！诶嘿嘿……！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "我、我想去！去吧，制作人先生……！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "你、你在做什么啊——！制作人先生——！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "快点过来啊——！",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦、哦哦……！我这就来……！",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……我，这个从以前就一直想试一次……！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "是的！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "和制作人先生在一起，能经历好多以前没有过的经验呢……！",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "──哈、哈啊～……！好、好开心……！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。那太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……和制作人先生在一起，尽是以前没发生过的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "所以一定，过一阵子……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "很、很多事情都会慢慢顺利起来吧……！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "……为了那样，只能努力了呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "不过，今天的甄选稍微……有、有点顺利的感觉！",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "koito",
        "text": "虽然只有一点点——！"
      }
    }
  },
